ause of her  quirk  arrey accidentally killed her father as  a result she was abandoned by her mother  and because of the unique properties of  her quirk Arry was abused and  experimented on by overhaul after such  terrible experiences at such an early  age  anyone would  be forgiven if they came to view their  quark as a negative and dangerous thing  thanks to the terrible experiments that  overhaul conducted on Airy he discovered  that Aries blood has properties that can  take away the ability of other  individuals to use their quirks when  they come into contact with Aries blood  other people's bodies are rewound to a  state before their quirk manifested and  so they suddenly become quirk lists as  was the case with me do as we know  overhaul eventually ends up using Aries  blood to create special bullets that  will take away their targets ability to  use their quirk but even though Aries  quirk is the reason why media became  quirk lists after being shot with the  quirk destroying bullet Aizawa believes  that Aries quirk could also be the very  thing that allows me do to restore his  own quirk when eyes Owoh says this it is  not just a throwaway line I think that  Aries quirk will likely become a major  plot point in the boku no hero story  it's been a while since media lost the  ability to use his quirk and medial is  such an epic character with such a great  quirk that I find it very hard to  believe that horikoshi would just keep  me do quark lists for the rest of the  series instead I firmly believe that  media will eventually regain the ability  to use his quirk and based on what we  know so far it is likely that the method  which will be used to restore his quirk  is Aries power after all it was aries  blood that took away meteos ability to  use his quirk in the first place so it  is logical to think that as soon as he  learns to control her quirk she will be  the best person to restore meteos power  but restoring meteos quirk is only the  beginning knowing what we know so far  about ares abilities once she learns to  control her quirk she could potentially  do so much more she could change the  entire world of boku no hero she could  restore all might to his physical prime  she could revert kuru giri back into a  burro she could potentially even restore  all for one  to his physical prime if all-4-one is  able to somehow manipulate her  perhaps by threatening to kill someone  if she doesn't do it but more than that  arey could single-handedly become the  solution to the quark singularity issue  which has been raised many times  throughout the course of the story and  which is sure to become an important  plot point in the future work  singularity is a concept that the  villain dr. Daruma Fujiko claims to have  come up with many years ago quark  singularity refers to the idea that as  new generations of quark users are born  the quirks that the children are born  with will become stronger and stronger  as different powerful quirks mix  together to create even more powerful  quirks the world will eventually get to  the point where quirks that a user  manifests are just too strong for him or  her to control as illogical puts it the  memory will exceed the hardware meaning  that the raw power of the quark will  exceed the capabilities of the quark  user's body according to Foucault this  has already been happening since the  fourth generation of quark users arrey  herself can of course be considered a  prime example of the quark singularity  issue the quark she manifested as a  child was a mutation that didn't  resemble the quark of her parents and it  was so powerful and so destructive that  she couldn't control it  her own father died as a result of Ares  inability to control her quark logical  believes that as more and more quirks  continued to mix together over the  coming generations this phenomenon will  become more and more common and  eventually the entire world will be  thrown into chaos but here is the ironic  thing even though Airy is herself an  example of the dangers of quark  singularity she could also turn out to  be the cure for the quark singularity  problem assuming that Ares training will  be effective and that she will learn to  control her quark arrey will be able to  actually help children who manifest  quirks that are too powerful for them to  control theoretically Airy will be able  to rewind the children's bodies to a  point where their quark had not  yet manifested until they are old enough  to actually control their quirks so if  there is ever a quirk singularity arc in  boku no hero  I predict that arey will be the star of  that arc we've certainly been getting  hints in the story that children are  being born with stronger and stronger  quirks and we've had multiple examples  of children accidentally killing people  including members of their own family  specifically because they were unable to  control their quirks examples of this  include both airy and shigaraki I really  don't think that this quirk singularity  concept would have been introduced and  repeated so frequently if horikoshi  didn't intend to make a bigger deal out  of it in the future the other important  thing that we have to remember about  Aries quirk is that its current  abilities could only be the beginning of  what her quirk will be able to  accomplish once area is able to access  its full potential  we have recently seen multiple quirks  straight-up awaken and evolve in boku no  hero and while we could say that the  evolution of one for all is a one-off  because one for all is so unique the  evolution of quirks like Sagara Keys  decay and togas transform demonstrate  that quirks can still become far more  powerful and exhibit additional  abilities well into the users adulthood  so what if Aries ability to rewind  people's bodies is just scratching the  surface of her full quirk potential  what if era can eventually learn to  rewind multiple people at once  or even large groups of people overhaul  believed that he could one day use aries  power to take away the quirks of  humanity as a whole so is it possible  for arey to one day literally alter the  physical components of the entire human  race with her quirk could she one day  decide that the world would be a better  place if quirks didn't exist after all  her own quirk has been more of a curse  than a blessing for her could airy one  day become something like a villain who  wants to use her quirk to erase all  quirks from existence as intriguing as  this sounds I doubt it but who knows  what kind of abilities Aries quirk could  unlock in the future could we  to the point at which arey learns to  rewind time itself or actually send  people back in time instead of just  rewinding their bodies there are many  intriguing possibilities with this quirk  and I personally can't wait to find out  where Aries story goes from here we do  have to remember that Aries quirk is an  accumulation type quirk so Airy does not  have unlimited power her quirk will  likely get much stronger but its power  will never be unlimited because Airy  needs to take some time to charge up her  power store it and then release it when  the time is right this means that the  amount she can store is inevitably going  to be limited even if that limit ends up  being a high one I personally believe  that Airy will remain a good guy and  that she may eventually become a star of  her own spin-off or next generation boku  no hero series MHA already has the  vigilantes spin-off and provided that  the popularity of boku no hero remains  as high as it is now it isn't out of the  question that a new spin-off with  younger characters like arey could  appear this is especially possible once  the current main cast graduates from  high school since area is so much  younger than them if horikoshi wants to  create another high school story for a  new generation in a few years he could  make a spin-off that focuses on Arry and  other younger characters starting their  journey in UA as the current main cast  focuses on being pro heroes and adulting  in general we could even have a  situation where the main story ends  there is a time skip and then airy and  her age group become the main cast with  the current main cast becoming new UA  teachers it's like boruto the next  generation but for boku no hero isn't  that exciting okay fine I know that  boruto isn't the best example to use and  a lot of people would hate that idea but  if the series is making a lot of money  and the main story winds down you better  believe that they will find some way to  keep cashing in and a next generation  could be the way to do it  now obviously I'm not saying that this  will happen for sure or that area will  definitely become the new main character  of the story but I do firm  that area is going to become an  increasingly important character  especially due to the incredible nature  of her quark with all the talk about  quark singularity with the insane  evolution and awakening of quirks in  recent arcs and with me do still being  quark lists I think that airy and her  quark rewind are going to become  critical plot elements in the near  future let me know what you guys think  do you agree with me that area will  become an increasingly important  character to the story or do you think  that she will just remain an adorable  side character also assuming that Ares  quark could keep getting stronger and  stronger in the future what other  additional powers do you think that she  might be able to unlock rewinding time  itself rewinding all of humanity let me  know down below if you enjoyed this  video and you want to see more videos in  this style on this channel please leave  a like to let me know and if you happen  to be new to anime uproar please don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications don't forget that you can  now listen to our videos in podcast  format just look up ani